### Test Purpose:
Design a set of functional test cases to verify the correct operation of the Bluetooth feature in a wireless headphone device.

### Initial Condition:
The wireless headphone device is in its default state, with the Bluetooth feature enabled and paired with a smartphone.

### Test Procedure:
